Adicionar favorito
POST /clients/:id/favorites

Body:

{
  "productId": 1
}
Listar favoritos
GET /clients/:id/favorites

Tu vai buscar:

https://fakestoreapi.com/products/{id}

E retornar:

{
  "id": 1,
  "title": "Product",
  "image": "...",
  "price": 100,
  "rating": {
    "rate": 4.5
  }
}
Remover favorito
DELETE /clients/:id/favorites/:productId
